[{:db/id "0c077cd0-2351-59df-ad6c-8aab69280242" :answer/id #uuid "0c077cd0-2351-59df-ad6c-8aab69280242" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x^{2} + 7 {e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e5b2aa22-455a-598e-b62b-e07e581f6245" :answer/id #uuid "e5b2aa22-455a-598e-b62b-e07e581f6245" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = 4 x + 7 {e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e93b103b-69d5-54b8-8835-73ba24248ebe" :answer/id #uuid "e93b103b-69d5-54b8-8835-73ba24248ebe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4c18906d-af9d-50af-a0a0-606329921b7f" :answer/id #uuid "4c18906d-af9d-50af-a0a0-606329921b7f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 2 x^{2} + 7 {e}^{x} + 1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4524e138-4f75-58ce-8eac-a0ba2babd8e1" :answer/id #uuid "4524e138-4f75-58ce-8eac-a0ba2babd8e1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x + 7 {e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "98e74756-78f6-5562-bfaf-b4a28a0ceae1" :answer-field/id #uuid "98e74756-78f6-5562-bfaf-b4a28a0ceae1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["0c077cd0-2351-59df-ad6c-8aab69280242" "e5b2aa22-455a-598e-b62b-e07e581f6245" "e93b103b-69d5-54b8-8835-73ba24248ebe" "4c18906d-af9d-50af-a0a0-606329921b7f" "4524e138-4f75-58ce-8eac-a0ba2babd8e1"] :answer-field/correct "4524e138-4f75-58ce-8eac-a0ba2babd8e1" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "715a8ac6-fd66-549a-b175-7f154dd14992" :question/id #uuid "715a8ac6-fd66-549a-b175-7f154dd14992" :question/problem "Given that $f(x) = 7{e}^{x} - 2{x}^{2} + 1$, find $f^{′}(x)$." :question/worked-solution "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+1) \\\\ & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7{e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\ & =7\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(1) \\\\ & =7{e}^{x}-2(2x)+0 \\\\ & =7{e}^{x}-4x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["98e74756-78f6-5562-bfaf-b4a28a0ceae1"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "4240f985-39e5-562c-b2bb-d7717724b4ac" :answer/id #uuid "4240f985-39e5-562c-b2bb-d7717724b4ac" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 3 x^{2} + {e}^{x} - 6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "5b979ad6-5e79-5e4a-b8a8-3843a32c1653" :answer-field/id #uuid "5b979ad6-5e79-5e4a-b8a8-3843a32c1653" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["4240f985-39e5-562c-b2bb-d7717724b4ac"] :answer-field/correct "4240f985-39e5-562c-b2bb-d7717724b4ac" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "bd74a88f-3e9e-54af-946f-d004983e42ec" :question/id #uuid "bd74a88f-3e9e-54af-946f-d004983e42ec" :question/problem "Let $f(x)={x}^{3}+6x$ and $g(x)={e}^{x}$. If $k(x)=g(x)-f(x)$, then $\\frac{\\text{d}k}{\\text{d}x}=$ {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "Using the given definitions, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}k(x) & =g(x)-f(x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}-({x}^{3}+6x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}-{x}^{3}-6x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the addition and power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}k}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x}-{x}^{3}-6x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{3})-6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x) \\\\  & ={e}^{x}-3{x}^{2}-6.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["5b979ad6-5e79-5e4a-b8a8-3843a32c1653"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "9a5f9195-c783-5942-b1b6-5d4846b65829" :answer/id #uuid "9a5f9195-c783-5942-b1b6-5d4846b65829" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "78a011dd-a74b-5bbc-b5d6-8275fe17ca27" :answer/id #uuid "78a011dd-a74b-5bbc-b5d6-8275fe17ca27" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "378eaac1-345c-512c-a16b-58906597b996" :answer/id #uuid "378eaac1-345c-512c-a16b-58906597b996" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4 + 4 e" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "f005995a-9e62-5f8e-8d5f-d4fb01df4d4f" :answer/id #uuid "f005995a-9e62-5f8e-8d5f-d4fb01df4d4f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6 + 4 e" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d8570adb-6a59-51ea-b794-010013286008" :answer/id #uuid "d8570adb-6a59-51ea-b794-010013286008" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4 + e" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "3e3ec696-1582-555e-9dbf-45a7fab2a2e2" :answer-field/id #uuid "3e3ec696-1582-555e-9dbf-45a7fab2a2e2" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["9a5f9195-c783-5942-b1b6-5d4846b65829" "78a011dd-a74b-5bbc-b5d6-8275fe17ca27" "378eaac1-345c-512c-a16b-58906597b996" "f005995a-9e62-5f8e-8d5f-d4fb01df4d4f" "d8570adb-6a59-51ea-b794-010013286008"] :answer-field/correct "378eaac1-345c-512c-a16b-58906597b996" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "bf13a195-c5b0-5308-8807-0ec8ba1fef3d" :question/id #uuid "bf13a195-c5b0-5308-8807-0ec8ba1fef3d" :question/problem "Given that $g(x)=4{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+8$, find the slope of the tangent at $x=1.$" :question/worked-solution "First, using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+8) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{x})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8) \\\\  & =4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+0 \\\\  & =4{e}^{x}-4x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=1$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}g}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=1} & ={(4{e}^{x}-4x)\\,|}_{x=1} \\\\  & =4{e}^{1}-4\\cdot 1 \\\\  & =-4 + 4 e.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["3e3ec696-1582-555e-9dbf-45a7fab2a2e2"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "7d0b85b2-e227-5623-8a7b-b5185e175d05" :answer/id #uuid "7d0b85b2-e227-5623-8a7b-b5185e175d05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x - 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0f741772-bdac-5ed5-a560-d0b055af6796" :answer/id #uuid "0f741772-bdac-5ed5-a560-d0b055af6796" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 2 x^{2} - 2 x + 7 {e}^{x} - 18" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "55137985-cfd6-539f-9ec0-36464054b534" :answer/id #uuid "55137985-cfd6-539f-9ec0-36464054b534" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x^{2} - 2 x + 7 {e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "479af8c5-6a44-55dc-9ab9-2055ef1053b5" :answer/id #uuid "479af8c5-6a44-55dc-9ab9-2055ef1053b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = 4 x + 7 {e}^{x} + 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6f7be2e7-06e7-59b3-88f3-f7ef84747c72" :answer/id #uuid "6f7be2e7-06e7-59b3-88f3-f7ef84747c72" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "f^{′}(x) = - 4 x + 7 {e}^{x} - 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "aafc2dae-bc89-5829-a8cb-4b00486270c7" :answer-field/id #uuid "aafc2dae-bc89-5829-a8cb-4b00486270c7" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["7d0b85b2-e227-5623-8a7b-b5185e175d05" "0f741772-bdac-5ed5-a560-d0b055af6796" "55137985-cfd6-539f-9ec0-36464054b534" "479af8c5-6a44-55dc-9ab9-2055ef1053b5" "6f7be2e7-06e7-59b3-88f3-f7ef84747c72"] :answer-field/correct "6f7be2e7-06e7-59b3-88f3-f7ef84747c72" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "a8456306-9118-592b-ba3e-acf608603d3d" :question/id #uuid "a8456306-9118-592b-ba3e-acf608603d3d" :question/problem "Given that $f(x) = 7{e}^{x} - 2{x}^{2} - 2x - 18$, find $f^{′}(x)$." :question/worked-solution "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f'(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}-2x-18) \\\\ & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7{e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{2})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(18) \\\\ & =7\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(18) \\\\ & =7{e}^{x}-2(2x)-2(1)-0 \\\\ & =7{e}^{x}-4x-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["aafc2dae-bc89-5829-a8cb-4b00486270c7"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "d10f51fd-2edb-5a32-bc19-2e4a94080d55" :answer/id #uuid "d10f51fd-2edb-5a32-bc19-2e4a94080d55" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 14 x - 2 {e}^{x} + 2" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "eb7dd7ab-94a9-53fc-950b-f401d8d15a8b" :answer-field/id #uuid "eb7dd7ab-94a9-53fc-950b-f401d8d15a8b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["d10f51fd-2edb-5a32-bc19-2e4a94080d55"] :answer-field/correct "d10f51fd-2edb-5a32-bc19-2e4a94080d55" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "79103b32-86de-5f9f-9f15-ae04d815512a" :question/id #uuid "79103b32-86de-5f9f-9f15-ae04d815512a" :question/problem "For $x<3$, let $g(x)=-2{e}^{x}-7{x}^{2}+2x$. Then $g'(x)=$ {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "For $x<3,$ we use the expression $g(x)=-2{e}^{x}-7{x}^{2}+2x,$ which is differentiable.\n\nUsing the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-2{e}^{x}-7{x}^{2}+2x) \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x) \\\\  & =-2{e}^{x}-14x+2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["eb7dd7ab-94a9-53fc-950b-f401d8d15a8b"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "3dec44db-d3cb-59f1-92b9-563c2b18a384" :answer/id #uuid "3dec44db-d3cb-59f1-92b9-563c2b18a384" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "d0f3ab96-00df-566a-9cce-13458e6ae6ce" :answer/id #uuid "d0f3ab96-00df-566a-9cce-13458e6ae6ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2 + 4 e" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "9696aa59-67e6-5f86-8201-e0fb228932fb" :answer/id #uuid "9696aa59-67e6-5f86-8201-e0fb228932fb" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "2d12640e-9820-5eeb-9be9-8968cc21917d" :answer/id #uuid "2d12640e-9820-5eeb-9be9-8968cc21917d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "ff0def7f-9d0e-59d5-9da7-e4ec2b08fa2c" :answer/id #uuid "ff0def7f-9d0e-59d5-9da7-e4ec2b08fa2c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "e7c52da8-18b7-553b-bb92-2561fc678ce5" :answer-field/id #uuid "e7c52da8-18b7-553b-bb92-2561fc678ce5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["3dec44db-d3cb-59f1-92b9-563c2b18a384" "d0f3ab96-00df-566a-9cce-13458e6ae6ce" "9696aa59-67e6-5f86-8201-e0fb228932fb" "2d12640e-9820-5eeb-9be9-8968cc21917d" "ff0def7f-9d0e-59d5-9da7-e4ec2b08fa2c"] :answer-field/correct "9696aa59-67e6-5f86-8201-e0fb228932fb" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "fc8205dd-9383-5240-aa7c-245bff3c1e94" :question/id #uuid "fc8205dd-9383-5240-aa7c-245bff3c1e94" :question/problem "Given that $g(x)=4{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+6x+8$, find the slope of the tangent at $x=0.$" :question/worked-solution "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{g}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{x}-2{x}^{2}+6x+8) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8) \\\\  & =4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8) \\\\  & =4{e}^{x}-2(2x)+6(1)+0 \\\\  & =4{e}^{x}-4x+6.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent at $x=0$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\frac{\\text{d}g}{\\text{d}x}|}_{x=0} & ={(4{e}^{x}-4x+6)\\,|}_{x=0} \\\\  & =4{e}^{0}-4\\cdot 0+6 \\\\  & =4\\cdot 1+0+6 \\\\  & =4+6 \\\\  & =10.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["e7c52da8-18b7-553b-bb92-2561fc678ce5"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "232f1e72-6ccc-567c-9623-b031fc2f416b" :answer/id #uuid "232f1e72-6ccc-567c-9623-b031fc2f416b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "g^{′}(x) = - 8 x^{2} + x + 5 {e}^{x}" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6d649614-428e-5c60-848d-c146e9ec3146" :answer/id #uuid "6d649614-428e-5c60-848d-c146e9ec3146" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "g^{′}(x) = - 4 x^{2} + x + 5 {e}^{x} - 11" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0efb720c-6b9b-574c-974f-4e3c638f5136" :answer/id #uuid "0efb720c-6b9b-574c-974f-4e3c638f5136" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "g^{′}(x) = 8 x + 5 {e}^{x} - 1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0f356b7c-2ebf-5896-998d-b4ccddf5e0e0" :answer/id #uuid "0f356b7c-2ebf-5896-998d-b4ccddf5e0e0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "g^{′}(x) = - 8 x + 5 {e}^{x} + 1" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "65f0319e-35aa-5bee-adbf-801f31daf544" :answer/id #uuid "65f0319e-35aa-5bee-adbf-801f31daf544" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "g^{′}(x) = 1 - 8 x" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "da9114b8-ab35-5b36-bac6-1ba9998ddc7d" :answer-field/id #uuid "da9114b8-ab35-5b36-bac6-1ba9998ddc7d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["232f1e72-6ccc-567c-9623-b031fc2f416b" "6d649614-428e-5c60-848d-c146e9ec3146" "0efb720c-6b9b-574c-974f-4e3c638f5136" "0f356b7c-2ebf-5896-998d-b4ccddf5e0e0" "65f0319e-35aa-5bee-adbf-801f31daf544"] :answer-field/correct "0f356b7c-2ebf-5896-998d-b4ccddf5e0e0" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "bbc1984d-8d4d-5124-b526-4edb9aabc7e9" :question/id #uuid "bbc1984d-8d4d-5124-b526-4edb9aabc7e9" :question/problem "Given that $g(x) = 5{e}^{x} - 4{x}^{2} + x - 11$, find $g^{′}(x)$." :question/worked-solution "Using the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}g'(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{e}^{x}-4{x}^{2}+x-11) \\\\ & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(5{e}^{x})-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4{x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11) \\\\ & =5\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{x})-4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2})+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(11) \\\\ & =5{e}^{x}-4(2x)+(1)-0 \\\\ & =5{e}^{x}-8x+1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["da9114b8-ab35-5b36-bac6-1ba9998ddc7d"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "f8385fd8-392a-5b32-9696-5e38de0d0d87" :answer/id #uuid "f8385fd8-392a-5b32-9696-5e38de0d0d87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "- 8 x + 4 {e}^{x} - 6" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "086120ff-05da-5c65-b0da-0f61f2c27711" :answer-field/id #uuid "086120ff-05da-5c65-b0da-0f61f2c27711" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/choices ["f8385fd8-392a-5b32-9696-5e38de0d0d87"] :answer-field/correct "f8385fd8-392a-5b32-9696-5e38de0d0d87" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "39b1266c-5944-5dcf-b535-d35e41bcefcb" :question/id #uuid "39b1266c-5944-5dcf-b535-d35e41bcefcb" :question/problem "For $x<-3$, let $f(x)=4{e}^{x}-4{x}^{2}-6x$. Then $f'(x)=$ {{field-1}}." :question/worked-solution "For $x<-3,$ we use the expression $f(x)=4{e}^{x}-4{x}^{2}-6x,$ which is differentiable.\n\nUsing the addition and the power rules, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x